+`printf 'ANDROID_HOME=%s\n' "$ANDROID_HOME"`
+
+`flutter doctor -v`
+
+## Reviewer checklist
+
+- Confirm SHA-1 and SHA-256 round functions, padding, endianness, length accounting, and all constants against FIPS PUB 180-4.
+- Confirm every full Git object frame is screened before it can cross an untrusted-to-trusted boundary.
+- Confirm untrusted transport remains fail-closed when collision screening is unavailable.
+- Confirm pack base, OFS_DELTA, and REF_DELTA reconstruction is screened as final canonical frames rather than compressed bytes or object IDs alone.
+- Confirm quarantine has no unreviewed installation path and recovery cannot remove valid objects.
+- Confirm error decisions are typed and messages contain no object contents or repository secrets.
+- Confirm a future generalized detector has clean provenance, a documented license, adversarial corpus coverage, bounded resource behavior, and separate review before G5-G7 enablement.
+- Do not mark this dossier reviewed or accepted without an independent cryptography reviewer and recorded approval.
